{"seq":12,"slug":"mathematical-modeling","title":"数学建模","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling","rating":{"composite":3.48,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数学建模 简介\n\n数学建模是将现实世界中的问题转化为数学问题并求解的系统方法。它是连接数学理论与实际应用的核心桥梁——无论是预测流行病的传播趋势、优化物流配送路线，还是评估金融衍生品的风险，都需要通过构建合适的数学模型来实现。对于程序员而言，数学建模能力是从\"会写代码\"走向\"能解决问题\"的关键跃迁。\n\n本知识库面向具有一定编程和数学基础、希望系统掌握数学建模方法论的中级程序员。如果你在工作中需要对业务数据进行建模分析，或者希望提升解决开放性问题的能力，本知识库将为你提供从方法论到具体模型的完整知识体系。\n\n第1章**建模方法论**讲解数学建模的基本流程、常用方法和评估准则，涵盖问题分析、假设简化、模型构建、求解验证和结果解释的全过程，帮助你建立系统的建模思维框架。\n\n第2章**连续模型**聚焦于基于微分方程和连续数学工具的建模方法，包括增长与衰减模型、传染病模型、优化模型以及偏微分方程模型，这些模型广泛应用于人口预测、物理仿真和工程设计中。\n\n第3章**离散模型**探讨基于图论、递推关系和整数规划等离散数学工具的建模方法，涵盖网络流模型、调度问题、博弈模型以及组合优化，这些模型在物流规划、资源分配和策略分析中有着直接应用。\n\n第4章**随机模型与仿真**介绍包含随机性的建模方法，包括概率模型、排队论、蒙特卡罗模拟以及随机过程基础，帮助你处理现实问题中无法消除的不确定性因素。\n\n建议学习路径为：先完成第一章建立建模方法论框架，再根据实际需求选择性学习第二至第四章。连续模型和离散模型可以根据你的数学背景和应用方向选择优先顺序，第四章的随机模型则建议在有一定概率论基础后再行学习。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modeling-methodology","title":"建模方法论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/modeling-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modeling-process","title":"建模流程","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/modeling-methodology/modeling-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"model-types","title":"模型分类","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/modeling-methodology/model-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"model-validation","title":"模型验证与评估","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/modeling-methodology/model-validation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sensitivity-analysis","title":"灵敏度分析","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/modeling-methodology/sensitivity-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuous-models","title":"连续模型","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/continuous-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ode-models","title":"常微分方程模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/ode-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pde-models","title":"偏微分方程模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/pde-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamical-systems","title":"动力系统","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/dynamical-systems"},{"seq":4,"slug":"population-models","title":"种群模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/continuous-models/population-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"discrete-models","title":"离散模型","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/discrete-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"difference-equations","title":"差分方程","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/discrete-models/difference-equations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-network-models","title":"图与网络模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/discrete-models/graph-network-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-theoretic-models","title":"博弈论模型","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/discrete-models/game-theoretic-models"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cellular-automata","title":"元胞自动机","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/discrete-models/cellular-automata"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"stochastic-models","title":"随机模型与仿真","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/stochastic-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"markov-chains","title":"马尔可夫链","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/stochastic-models/markov-chains"},{"seq":2,"slug":"queuing-theory","title":"排队论","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/stochastic-models/queuing-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monte-carlo","title":"蒙特卡罗方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/stochastic-models/monte-carlo"},{"seq":4,"slug":"agent-based-modeling","title":"基于代理的建模","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-modeling/stochastic-models/agent-based-modeling"}]}]}